+"""Generated high-confidence OpenCC 1.4.2 script markers.
+
+A character is listed only when OpenCC has no identity candidate for it.
+This intentionally avoids ambiguous context-dependent mappings such as
+乾/干 and keeps binary-size and false-positive risk low.
+"""
